2:T5ca,<h1>The UK's Most Versatile <span class="ident">Character Voiceover</span> Artist</h1>
<p>Across TV, radio, games, apps and animation, my character voices pop up everywhere. From heroic narrators to unhinged goblins, 
and from blockbuster game villains to silly cartoon sidekicks — I lend my voice to worlds big and small. 
If you’ve got a script bursting with personality, I can bring it to life.</p>

<!-- Mini Player Character Voice -->
<div style="margin:20px 0;">
  <audio controls style="width:100%; max-width:420px;">
    <source src="/assets/audio/guy-harris-voiceoverguy-character-showreel.mp3" type="audio/mpeg">
    Your browser does not support the audio element.
  </audio>
  <p style="font-size:0.9em; opacity:0.8; margin-top:5px;">
    Character Voice Showreel – Guy Harris
  </p>
</div>

<p>I've created iconic character voices for <a href="/boom-beach-hammerman-voice" title="Boom Beach Hammerman Voiceover">Boom Beach</a>, 
<a href="/minecraft-combat-voiceover" title="Minecraft Character Voice">Minecraft</a>, 
<a href="/clash-of-clans-goblins-voiceover" title="Clash of Clans Goblin Voice">Clash of Clans</a>, 
<a href="/thomas-the-tank-engine-voice-of-salty" title="Salty Thomas & Friends">Thomas & Friends</a>, 
<a href="/joker-voice" title="Joker Voiceover">The Joker</a>, 
and even <a href="/playmobil-pirate-voice" title="Pirate Voiceover">singing pirates</a>.  
If it’s wild, wacky or wonderfully weird — I’m your guy.</p>3:T44c,<h2><span class="ident">Crazy Voice Guy</span> | Unique Voices for Unique Characters</h2>
<p>Hi there — I’m the Crazy Voice Guy. Whether you need a gangsta raccoon, a hopelessly romantic robot, a grumpy wizard,
a lovable dog, or a full-on cartoon lunatic, I’m always up for creating something new. Character work is where I get to play,
experiment and throw everything at the wall until the perfect voice appears.</p>

<p>Want to hear some more? This showreel features gaming voices, silly accents, singing characters and some truly daft creations.
If you need a voice with personality (or several personalities), let’s chat.</p>

<p>For more examples, check out:
<br>&bull; <a href="/super-hero-voice" title="Super Hero Voice">Super Hero Voice</a>
<br>&bull; <a href="/seabrooks-in-for-a-penny-sponsor-voiceover" title="Crazy Seabrooks Penny Voice">Seabrooks “In For a Penny”</a>
<br>&bull; <a href="/scary-movie-ghost-face-voice" title="Ghost Face Voice">Ghost Face Voice</a>
<br>&bull; <a href="/pantomime-dame-voice" title="Panto Dame Voice">Pantomime Dame Voice</a>
</p>0:["Y3lXzMUYotEdWCFodbAa7",[[["",{"children":["character-voiceover",{"children":["__PAGE__",{}]}]},"$undefined","$undefined",true],["",{"children":["character-voiceover",{"children":["__PAGE__",{},[["$L1",["$","main",null,{"className":"inner-page","children":[["$","section",null,{"className":"inner-hero","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"inner-container","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h1>A page of <span class=\"ident\"> Character voiceover</span> showreels</h1>\r\n<p>My character voiceovers are heard on TV, Radio, Apps, Games & Virals worldwide daily. <br>\r\n“I hear voices in my head” that's me on a daily basis. So if you have a script and project, let me unleash them! </p>"}}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"inner-bar"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"inner-parallax","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"inner-container","children":[["$","div","0",{"className":"inner-row","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"inner-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$2"}}],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined"]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"inner-col","children":["$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"embed-wrap","children":["$","iframe",null,{"src":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Ad85PPvSfbc","title":"YouTube video","allow":"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture","allowFullScreen":true}]}],"$undefined","$undefined"]}]]}],["$","div","1",{"className":"inner-row reverse","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"inner-col","children":["$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"embed-wrap","children":["$","iframe",null,{"src":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/k7DZFWnOcvo","title":"YouTube video","allow":"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture","allowFullScreen":true}]}],"$undefined","$undefined"]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"inner-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$3"}}],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined"]}]]}],["$","div","2",{"className":"inner-row","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"inner-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>Let’s <span class=\"ident\">Work Together</span></h2>\r\n<p>Got a script ready? Or maybe you’ve just got a rough idea and need help shaping it? No problem. I can direct your session live via \r\nCleanfeed, Zoom or Teams, helping you fine-tune pacing, personality and performance.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Whether it’s a <a href=\"/masked-singer-voice-of-god-butlins\" title=\"Voice of God\">big booming announcer</a>, \r\na <a href=\"/pathe-news-jack-fm\" title=\"Pathe Voice\">retro Pathe News narrator</a>, \r\na <a href=\"/craig-cash-gogglebox-voiceover\" title=\"Craig Cash Voice\">Craig Cash-style Gogglebox character</a>,\r\nor a <a href=\"/star-wars-character-voices\" title=\"Star Wars Voice\">Star Wars creature voice</a>,\r\nI’m ready to help bring your character to life.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>If you’ve got a YouTube clip or reference voice you want me to start from, even better. \r\nReady to turn your character into something unforgettable? \r\n<a href=\"/contact-guy\" class=\"isred\" title=\"Contact Guy Harris\">Get in touch</a> today.</p>"}}],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined"]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"inner-col","children":["$undefined","$undefined","$undefined",["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/images/character-voiceover.jpg","alt":"Character Voiceover – Guy Harris","style":{"width":"100%","borderRadius":4,"marginTop":8}}]]}]]}]]}]}]]}],null],null],null]},[null,["$","$L4",null,{"parallelRouterKey":"children","segmentPath":["children","character-voiceover","children"],"error":"$undefined","errorStyles":"$undefined","errorScripts":"$undefined","template":["$","$L5",null,{}],"templateStyles":"$undefined","templateScripts":"$undefined","notFound":"$undefined","notFoundStyles":"$undefined"}]],null]},[[[["$","link","0",{"rel":"stylesheet","href":"/_next/static/css/f31072523b89a06f.css